  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/f7qd/86",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">이번 달 책은 &lt;음식혁명&gt;이었어요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">이 책은 제가 개인적으로 좋아하는&nbsp;책이어서 매번 아이들과 함께 읽고 있네요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/256C8634583273A132\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20161110_140854.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_256C8634583273A1323DB1\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/241F3A34583273A30C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20161110_142011.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_241F3A34583273A30CB9BC\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/22169C34583273A511\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20161110_142054.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_22169C34583273A5114DCB\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">책 읽고 난 뒤 활동으로는...</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">미니북 만들기를 했어요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">그리고 친구들에게 나눠 줄 책 홍보물을 명함 크기로 만들려고 했는데...</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">아이들이 미니북 만들고는...</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">뻗어버려서는...ㅎㅎ</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">만들지 못했네요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">실험활동은 DNA비즈 만들기 했습니다. </p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">간단하게 DNA공부하고... 비즈로 모형 만들기에 들어갔죠.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2406CB395832743002\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20161110_145644.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_2406CB395832743002DEF9\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/247F10395832743206\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20161110_145604.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_247F10395832743206F15C\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2605D0395832743503\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20161110_153447.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_2605D0395832743503C8FA\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">수준 차가 많이나요..ㅎ</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">섬세한 기술을 요하는 활동이라 호불호도 뚜렷하고요..</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;길게 만들수록 예쁘죠?&nbsp;<br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;<br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}